WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.220
Carbon Verify publishes a method, grades evidence and maintains a public register.

2
00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:09.230
It does not claim accreditation it has not earned.

3
00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:16.977
When a buyer needs an accredited certification conclusion, an appropriately accredited partner must sign within its own scope.

4
00:00:16.977 --> 00:00:24.698
Our role is to organise measurement, records and cryptographic commitments so the evidence is easier to review.

5
00:00:24.698 --> 00:00:31.730
This page separates what exists today from what is still pending, including governance appointments and accreditation.

6
00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:39.646
It also lists claims we never make, such as guaranteed regulatory compliance or independent validation of related-party work.
